From 63373c72cf3c57418d62ccf15c656ad395de117d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 02:42:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 48/58] fix(server): gateway limits review round 1

Refuse a connection whose socket cannot be duplicated while the receive
deadline is on, instead of admitting it with no deadline. Clamp an
over-range limit in config.json to its maximum rather than falling back to
off. Compute the payload limit in 64 bits. Log deadline closes once per
watchdog tick. Document that the deadline counts from when a worker serves
the connection, and that WebSocket upgrades leave both limits.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
